", "x": 11.11, "y": 59.85, "w": 62.51, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "redeems his", "x": 74.52, "y": 59.87, "w": 16.61, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "honour", "x": 11.11, "y": 61.81, "w": 9.16, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": ".", "x": 20.33, "y": 61.79, "w": 0.73, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Citizens! Don\u2019t believe those foul slanderers, Alexinsky", "x": 13.9, "y": 63.73, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "and", "x": 11.11, "y": 65.67, "w": 6.02, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Zhivoye", "x": 17.19, "y": 65.69, "w": 11.53, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "S", "x": 28.8, "y": 65.76, "w": 1.62, "h": 1.76, "fontSize": 10.4}, {"text": "lovo", "x": 30.4, "y": 65.69, "w": 5.17, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": ".", "x": 35.64, "y": 65.67, "w": 0.73, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Zhivoye", "x": 13.9, "y": 67.63, "w": 11.24, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "S", "x": 25.72, "y": 67.7, "w": 1.62, "h": 1.76, "fontSize": 10.4}, {"text": "lovo", "x": 27.5, "y": 67.63, "w": 5.39, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "\u2019s slander is evident at a glance from the", "x": 33.01, "y": 67.61, "w": 58.1, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "following: the paper writes that on", "x": 11.11, "y": 69.55, "w": 54.05, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "May 16", "x": 66.67, "y": 69.57, "w": 11.16, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "a letter", "x": 77.96, "y": 69.55, "w": 13.16, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "(No. 3719) accusing Lenin was sent to Kerensky from the", "x": 11.11, "y": 71.47, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "General Staff. Obviously, Kerensky would have been duty", "x": 11.11, "y": 73.41, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "bound to have Lenin arrested immediately and to order a", "x": 11.11, "y": 75.35, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "government investigation", "x": 11.11, "y": 77.3, "w": 35.31, "h": 1.